      },
      "changes": "Preserved the complete selected resource tree and scoped patterns to demonstrated architectural costs, project policy and compatible incremental choices. Kept modular monolith and simpler interface alternatives; made layers, repositories, ORM mapping, eventing and tool execution conditional. Moved fake tests on demand with explicit integration limits, corrected the borrowed-pool factory and quantity-aware Money totals with explicit unit rounding, populated required order-submission event fields from actual order values, replaced the blocking/global Stripe example with an injected asynchronous boundary, and made outbox encoding/commit/event ownership explicit. Added original attribution, generated UI metadata and immutable provenance."
